{
  "id": "6a709141cb9ed6d5fd4d4714",
  "title": "主の祈り",
  "created": 1785762115,
  "updated": 1785763328,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "6a709141cb9ed6d5fd4d4714",
      "text": "主の祈り",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762115,
      "updated": 1785762397
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7092780000000000b6cb5e",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762424,
      "updated": 1785762424
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7092780000000000b6cb5f",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762424,
      "updated": 1785762424
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7092780000000000b6cb60",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762424,
      "updated": 1785762424
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7092780000000000b6cb61",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762424,
      "updated": 1785762424
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7092780000000000b6cb62",
      "text": "[** 古典ギリシア語]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762424,
      "updated": 1785763229
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7092600000000000b6cb50",
      "text": " > Πάτερ ἡμῶν ὁ ἐν τοῖς οὐρανοῖς",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762400,
      "updated": 1785762456
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7092930000000000b6cb63",
      "text": " > ἁγιασθήτω τὸ ὄνομά σου·",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762451,
      "updated": 1785762456
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7092930000000000b6cb64",
      "text": " > ἐλθέτω ἡ βασιλεία σου·",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762451,
      "updated": 1785762456
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7092930000000000b6cb65",
      "text": " > γενηθήτω τὸ θέλημά σου,",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762451,
      "updated": 1785762456
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7092930000000000b6cb66",
      "text": " > ὡς ἐν οὐρανῷ καὶ ἐπὶ τῆς γῆς·",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762451,
      "updated": 1785762456
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7092930000000000b6cb67",
      "text": " > τὸν ἄρτον ἡμῶν τὸν ἐπιούσιον δὸς ἡμῖν σήμερον·",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762451,
      "updated": 1785762456
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7092930000000000b6cb68",
      "text": " > καὶ ἄφες ἡμῖν τὰ ὀφελήματα ἡμῶν,",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762451,
      "updated": 1785762456
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7092930000000000b6cb69",
      "text": " > ὡς καὶ ἡμεῖς ἀφίεμεν τοῖς ὀφειλέταις ἡμῶν·",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762451,
      "updated": 1785762456
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7092930000000000b6cb6a",
      "text": " > καὶ μὴ εἰσενέγκῃς ἡμᾶς εἰς πειρασμόν,",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762451,
      "updated": 1785762456
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7092930000000000b6cb6b",
      "text": " > ἀλλὰ ῥῦσαι ἡμᾶς ἀπὸ τοῦ πονηροῦ.",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762451,
      "updated": 1785762456
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7092930000000000b6cb6c",
      "text": " > Ὅτι σοῦ ἐστιν ἡ βασιλεία καὶ ἡ δύναμις καὶ ἡ δόξα εἰς τοὺς αἰῶνας·",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762451,
      "updated": 1785762456
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7092930000000000b6cb6d",
      "text": " > ἀμήν.",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762451,
      "updated": 1785762456
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7092600000000000b6cb51",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762400,
      "updated": 1785762400
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7095780000000000b6cbc1",
      "text": "[** ラテン語] #lang:la",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785763192,
      "updated": 1785763212
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7094ae0000000000b6cbaf",
      "text": "Vulgata Clementina (1692), [. Nova Vulgata Bibliorum Sacrorum Editio]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762990,
      "updated": 1785763031
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7094620000000000b6cba8",
      "text": " > pater noster qui es in cælis",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762915,
      "updated": 1785762933
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7094750000000000b6cba9",
      "text": " > sanctificetur nomen tuum",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762933,
      "updated": 1785762933
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7094750000000000b6cbaa",
      "text": " > adveniat regnum tuum",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762933,
      "updated": 1785762933
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7094750000000000b6cbab",
      "text": " > fiat voluntas tua sicut in cælo et in terra",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762933,
      "updated": 1785762933
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7094750000000000b6cbac",
      "text": " > panem nostrum supersubstantialem da nobis hodie",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762933,
      "updated": 1785762933
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7094750000000000b6cbad",
      "text": " > et dimitte nobis debita nostra sicut et nos dimittimus debitoribus nostris",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762933,
      "updated": 1785762933
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7094750000000000b6cbae",
      "text": " > et ne nos inducas in tentationem sed libera nos a malo(mala)",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762933,
      "updated": 1785762960
    },
    {
      "id": "6a70945c0000000000b6cba7",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762908,
      "updated": 1785762908
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7095460000000000b6cbbf",
      "text": "[** イタリア語] #lang:it",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785763143,
      "updated": 1785763159
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7095320000000000b6cbb3",
      "text": " > Padre nostro che sei nei cieli,",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785763122,
      "updated": 1785763125
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7095350000000000b6cbb4",
      "text": " > sia santificato il tuo nome",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785763125,
      "updated": 1785763125
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7095350000000000b6cbb5",
      "text": " > venga il tuo regno,",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785763125,
      "updated": 1785763125
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7095350000000000b6cbb6",
      "text": " > si attui la tua volontà,",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785763125,
      "updated": 1785763125
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7095350000000000b6cbb7",
      "text": " > come nel cielo così sulla terra.",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785763125,
      "updated": 1785763125
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7095350000000000b6cbb8",
      "text": " > il pane nostro quotidiano da' a noi oggi;",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785763125,
      "updated": 1785763125
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7095350000000000b6cbb9",
      "text": " > e rimetti a noi i nostri debiti,",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785763125,
      "updated": 1785763125
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7095350000000000b6cbba",
      "text": " > come anche noi li rimettiamo ai nostri debitori;",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785763125,
      "updated": 1785763125
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7095350000000000b6cbbb",
      "text": " > e non ci indurre in tentazione,",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785763125,
      "updated": 1785763125
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7095350000000000b6cbbc",
      "text": " > ma liberaci dal dolore.",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785763125,
      "updated": 1785763125
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7095350000000000b6cbbd",
      "text": " > (perché tuo il regno e la potenza e la gloria nei tempi)",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785763125,
      "updated": 1785763139
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7095350000000000b6cbbe",
      "text": " > Amen.",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785763125,
      "updated": 1785763126
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7095260000000000b6cbb1",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785763110,
      "updated": 1785763110
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7095650000000000b6cbc0",
      "text": "[** 英語] #lang:en",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785763173,
      "updated": 1785763184
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7092e00000000000b6cb6f",
      "text": "[/ [Lord's Prayer] / [Our Father]]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762528,
      "updated": 1785763261
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7093fb0000000000b6cb81",
      "text": "Matt. 6:9-13[. https://www.biblica.com/bible/?osis=niv:Matthew%206:9–13]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762812,
      "updated": 1785762861
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7094150000000000b6cb99",
      "text": " > Our Father in heaven,",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762837,
      "updated": 1785762843
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7094150000000000b6cb9a",
      "text": " > hallowed be your name,",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762837,
      "updated": 1785762843
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7094150000000000b6cb9b",
      "text": " > your kingdom come,",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762837,
      "updated": 1785762843
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7094150000000000b6cb9c",
      "text": " > your will be done,",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762837,
      "updated": 1785762843
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7094150000000000b6cb9d",
      "text": " > on earth as it is in heaven.",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762837,
      "updated": 1785762843
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7094150000000000b6cb9e",
      "text": " > Give us today our daily bread.",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762837,
      "updated": 1785762843
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7094150000000000b6cb9f",
      "text": " > And forgive us our debts,",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762837,
      "updated": 1785762843
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7094150000000000b6cba0",
      "text": " > as we also have forgiven our debtors.",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762837,
      "updated": 1785762843
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7094150000000000b6cba1",
      "text": " > And lead us not into temptation,",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762837,
      "updated": 1785762843
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7094150000000000b6cba2",
      "text": " > but deliver us from the evil one.",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762837,
      "updated": 1785762843
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7093fc0000000000b6cb82",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762812,
      "updated": 1785762812
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7093bb0000000000b6cb80",
      "text": "Luke 11:2-4[. https://www.biblica.com/bible/?osis=niv:Luke%2011:2–4]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762747,
      "updated": 1785762772
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7093960000000000b6cb79",
      "text": " > Father,",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762710,
      "updated": 1785762729
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7093960000000000b6cb7a",
      "text": " > hallowed be your name,",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762710,
      "updated": 1785762710
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7093960000000000b6cb7b",
      "text": " > your kingdom come.",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762710,
      "updated": 1785762710
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7093960000000000b6cb7c",
      "text": " > Give us each day our daily bread.",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762710,
      "updated": 1785762710
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7093960000000000b6cb7d",
      "text": " > Forgive us our sins,",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762710,
      "updated": 1785762710
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7093960000000000b6cb7e",
      "text": " > for we also forgive everyone who sins against us.",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762710,
      "updated": 1785762710
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7093960000000000b6cb7f",
      "text": " > And lead us not into temptation.",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762710,
      "updated": 1785762735
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7093240000000000b6cb70",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762597,
      "updated": 1785762597
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7095c80000000000b6cbc2",
      "text": "[** エスペラント語] #lang:eo",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785763272,
      "updated": 1785763287
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7091640000000000b6cb1f",
      "text": "el la 19a paĝo de la [Unua Libro], tradukis [L. L. Zamenhof]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762148,
      "updated": 1785762236
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7091430000000000b6cb12",
      "text": " > Patro nia, kiu estas en la ĉielo,",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762115,
      "updated": 1785762121
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7091490000000000b6cb14",
      "text": " > sankta estu Via nomo,",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762121,
      "updated": 1785762121
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7091490000000000b6cb15",
      "text": " > venu reĝeco Via,",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762121,
      "updated": 1785762121
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7091490000000000b6cb16",
      "text": " > estu volo Via,",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762121,
      "updated": 1785762121
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7091490000000000b6cb17",
      "text": " > kiel en la ĉielo, tiel ankaŭ sur la tero.",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762121,
      "updated": 1785762121
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7091490000000000b6cb18",
      "text": " > Panon nian ĉiutagan donu al ni hodiaŭ",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762121,
      "updated": 1785762121
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7091490000000000b6cb19",
      "text": " > kaj pardonu al ni ŝuldojn niajn",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762121,
      "updated": 1785762121
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7091490000000000b6cb1a",
      "text": " > kiel ni ankaŭ pardonas al niaj ŝuldantoj;",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762121,
      "updated": 1785762121
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7091490000000000b6cb1b",
      "text": " > ne konduku nin en tenton,",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762121,
      "updated": 1785762121
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7091490000000000b6cb1c",
      "text": " > sed liberigu nin de la malvera,",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762121,
      "updated": 1785762121
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7091490000000000b6cb1d",
      "text": " > ĉar Via estas la regado, la forto kaj la gloro eterne.",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762121,
      "updated": 1785762121
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7091490000000000b6cb1e",
      "text": " > Amen!",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762121,
      "updated": 1785762121
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7091450000000000b6cb13",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762467,
      "updated": 1785762467
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7091e80000000000b6cb22",
      "text": "Internacia Katolika Unuiĝo Esperantista[. [https://web.archive.org/web/20080914205439/http://www.ikue.org/arkivo/rozario.htm]].",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762280,
      "updated": 1785763313
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7092250000000000b6cb45",
      "text": " > Patro Nia, kiu estas en la ĉielo,",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762341,
      "updated": 1785762341
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7092250000000000b6cb46",
      "text": " > sanktigata estu via nomo.",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762341,
      "updated": 1785762341
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7092250000000000b6cb47",
      "text": " > Venu via Regno.",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762341,
      "updated": 1785762341
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7092250000000000b6cb48",
      "text": " > Fariĝu via volo,",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762341,
      "updated": 1785762341
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7092250000000000b6cb49",
      "text": " > kiel en la ĉielo tiel ankaŭ sur la tero.",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762341,
      "updated": 1785762341
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7092250000000000b6cb4a",
      "text": " > Nian panon ĉiutagan donu al ni hodiaŭ",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762341,
      "updated": 1785762341
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7092250000000000b6cb4b",
      "text": " > kaj pardonu al ni niajn ŝuldojn,",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762341,
      "updated": 1785762341
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7092250000000000b6cb4c",
      "text": " > kiel ankaŭ ni pardonas al niaj ŝuldantoj.",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762341,
      "updated": 1785762341
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7092250000000000b6cb4d",
      "text": " > Kaj ne konduku nin en tenton,",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762341,
      "updated": 1785762341
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7092250000000000b6cb4e",
      "text": " > sed liberigu nin de la malbono.",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762341,
      "updated": 1785762341
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7092250000000000b6cb4f",
      "text": " > Amen.",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785762341,
      "updated": 1785762341
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7091ea0000000000b6cb23",
